"help.incomplete.body" = "Please make sure the app has permission to access Desktop, Documents, and other folders you sync through iCloud Drive. If entries are still missing, you can also grant Full Disk Access. This project is fully open source, auditable, and reproducible. Feedback about parsing mistakes or missing entries is welcome.";
"help.privacy.title" = "Why does it request access to Desktop and Documents?";
"help.privacy.body" = "The app reconstructs file paths from live iCloud sync events. If your synced files live in Desktop, Documents, or other protected folders, macOS requires file access permission so the app can resolve those paths. The project is fully open source and auditable.";
"about.title" = "About iCloud Sync Watch";
"about.body" = "This app is fully open source, auditable, and reproducible. It reads live iCloud sync activity from macOS and shows a lightweight menu bar view of recent file transfers. Historical log playback is intentionally not included.";
